        "name": "VPS雷达推荐的VPS提供商有哪些？",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "VPS雷达目前收录了RackNerd、BandwagonHost（搬瓦工）、Cloudcone等知名VPS提供商的限时优惠和长期方案。所有方案都经过人工审核，确保配置真实、价格透明。"
        }
      }
    ]
  })} />

  <div class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <section class="relative" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_left,_rgba(16,185,129,0.18),_transparent_32%),radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,_rgba(59,130,246,0.16),_transparent_28%),linear-gradient(180deg,_rgba(15,23,42,0.02),_transparent_50%)]"></div>
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
        <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_0.7fr] lg:items-end">
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h1 id="hero-heading" class="max-w-3xl text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white md:text-6xl">
                2024年最适合中国用户的VPS推荐：便宜、稳定、线路优化
              </h1>
              <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
                VPS雷达整理了<mark class="bg-emerald-100 px-1 dark:bg-emerald-900/50">RackNerd、BandwagonHost、Cloudcone</mark>等主流提供商的限时优惠和长期方案，涵盖<mark class="bg-sky-100 px-1 dark:bg-sky-900/50">美国、日本、欧洲、新加坡</mark>等多地区节点，价格从<mark class="bg-amber-100 px-1 dark:bg-amber-900/50">$10/年</mark>起。所有方案均经过人工审核，配置真实可查。
